item.casual_tinkering.circular_saw.name=Circular Saw
item.casual_tinkering.circular_saw.desc=A heavy woodcutting tool with a spinning blade. Charges up to unleash a wide sweeping attack.\nRight Click: Charge and unleash area attack
item.casualtinkering.magicdevice.name=Magic Device
item.casualtinkering.magicdevice.desc=A weapon imbued with arcane power, capable of summoning magical swords to assist in combat.\nRight-click: Charge to conjure magical swords for a mid-range strike.\nOff-hand: Main-hand sword strikes call forth a magic sword.\nFull attack: Summons an additional sword.